; The variables are the draw order and the transform alignment of a GPUParticles3D, seen through a
; Camera3D turned 30 degrees about Y. The top row is four emitters of one flying quad: DISABLED,
; Z_BILLBOARD, Y_TO_VELOCITY and Z_BILLBOARD_Y_TO_VELOCITY. The bottom row is two clouds of lit alpha
; quads along the view axis, drawn by LIFETIME and by VIEW_DEPTH. No other golden shows a regression
; in the copy shader of a GPUParticles3D: the other scenes draw the index order with no alignment.
